============================================================================================
THE FOURIER PAIR-RESONANCE KERNEL  c_pair = sum_{n!=0}|hhat(n)|^4
============================================================================================
  c_pair = theta^3(2/3 - theta) = 11/7203 = 1.52714147e-03  (theta=1/7)
    = k=2 tent variance 2theta^3/3 - theta^4;  Var_pair(W) = (R2/2)*c_pair

