  READING: s(2) = 1 EXACTLY (pair kernel exact at k=2); s(k) FALLS as coverage k*theta
  grows (the multiple-overlap screening).  Var/R2 = s(k)*c_pair/2 -- so the effective
  c(k) = s(k)*c_pair/2; at k=11 (k*theta=1.57) s~0.08 => c ~ 6e-5 (klein's constant).

